TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0706.2213v3
AU  - JÉR ÔME DUBOIS, VU HUYNH
AU  - YAMAGUCHI, YOSHIKAZU
TI  - NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS
DA  - D:20210726
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0706.2213
AB  - This paper gives an explicit formula for the SL 2(C)−non–abelian Reidemeister torsion as deﬁned in [Dub06] in the case of twist knots. For hyperbolic twist knots, we also prove that the non–abelian Reidemeister torsion at the holonomy representation can be expressed as a rational function evaluated at the cusp shape of the knot.
ER  - 
